{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_17208490","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17208490","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"subtitle:2:1720848001:":{"text":"Holding the bouquet and the box, Valen heads onto the dance floor.","source_cn":"捧着花和宝盒，维伦切入舞圈","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15AA372B56D3DFDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1720848002:":{"text":"And heads straight toward Charlotte, who's dancing.","source_cn":"径直走向舞蹈着的夏洛蒂","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49E91ADF1526B3E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1720848003:":{"text":"Everyone was too stunned to stop him.","source_cn":"所有人都忘记了阻止他的动作","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45FC8557D6B60C4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1720848004:":{"text":"Some even step aside without thinking.","source_cn":"甚至不由自主地为他让开了路","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3C1F700FC774177","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720848005:":{"text":"Hold on, you're...","source_cn":"等一下，你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB327A19407A7723B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720848006:":{"text":"Valen?","source_cn":"维伦？<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC471C5AE0A837465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720848007:":{"text":"May I have this dance?","source_cn":"能否请你跳一支舞？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2165005F507B0E14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720848008:":{"text":"... Of course.","source_cn":"……当然","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7890A1DD6E096020","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720849001:0":{"text":"I never thought you'd actually come.","source_cn":"维伦，我从没想过你真的会来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E06DDB01F9825F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720849002:0":{"text":"When I extended the invitation, you brushed it off so easily. I assumed you wouldn't show.","source_cn":"我递给你邀请函时，你毫不犹豫地模糊过去了。我以为你不会来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EADD54953041211","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720849003:1":{"text":"Still... I'm glad. Thank you for coming.","source_cn":"我的意思是……我很开心。谢谢你能过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96C01410B5001BCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720849004:0":{"text":"Do you like the gift?","source_cn":"礼物还喜欢吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x894F4CC6F8F9BDCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720849005:0":{"text":"The one Adrion is holding? I suppose I'll open it properly after the banquet.","source_cn":"你是指亚德里恩的手里那份？我恐怕要在舞会后才能仔细拆开看了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD361538B1BD2EDCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720849006:0":{"text":"Though... that hardly matters. Your presence alone is already a gift.","source_cn":"这都无所谓。你来了，就是最好的礼物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F7DD6532A828CC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720849007:0":{"text":"So why did you come?","source_cn":"你为什么会来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94D6FD1B0B293933","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720849008:0":{"text":"I just remembered... we once made a promise. To share a dance at a ball.","source_cn":"我只是忽然想起，过去的确和你有过约定，要在一次舞会上共舞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B6962ABA133AB11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720849009:0":{"text":"You remembered.","source_cn":"你还记得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68A880ECE782B20F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1720849010:0":{"text":"You're stepping into a new chapter. But if something from the past is left unresolved... it tends to linger.","source_cn":"虽说即将迈入人生的新阶段，但若是在过去留下遗憾，难免也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FA644FAA00DC821","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720849011:0":{"text":"The past is behind us now. We both have to move forward.","source_cn":"过去的事都已经过去了，我们都要继续往前走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04749EE9CF91A924","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1720849012:0":{"text":"So let this dance be a proper farewell to it.","source_cn":"今天这支舞，请将它当做对过去彻底的告别吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE140E5FA6A29D13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1720849013:0":{"text":"Lady Charlotte, may your future be free of the past's shadows.","source_cn":"夏洛蒂小姐，愿您的未来，能够不必沾染过去的影子，不受约...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21FD5ECBB4BACA55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1720849014:0":{"text":"May you do as you wish, be with who you truly desire, and live the life you truly want.","source_cn":"去做您想做的事，与您真正想要相伴一生的人在一起，过您真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE63E0FD8E93CFE8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1720849015:1":{"text":"Is that your wish as well?","source_cn":"这也是你的愿望吗，维伦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91E314D5F1875782","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1720849016:0":{"text":"... Hm. But that's not my wish.","source_cn":"……哼，但这可不是我的愿望哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD0E7AC6A9A7588D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1720849017:0":{"text":"Huh...?","source_cn":"呃……夏洛蒂小姐？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58D34FF987527BEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1720849018:0":{"text":"Now that you're here, you're not getting away. How about we run off together?","source_cn":"既然你来了，那就别想走。我们私奔怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67F43F5BF8975F71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1720849019:0":{"text":"Lady Charlotte, I—","source_cn":"夏洛蒂小姐，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCF5BD53CBEADC22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1720849020:0":{"text":"Hahaha! Forgive me, I couldn't resist.","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈……吓唬你的啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF729EC22FFD2DC3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1720849021:0":{"text":"It's not often I get to see you caught off guard. Quite worth it. Alright, I think I've said what I needed to.","source_cn":"难得见你大惊失色的模样。好啦，这下我心里堵着的那口气，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54A8E5D4231C2AFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1720849022:1":{"text":"Go on, Valen. Wherever it is you need to be.","source_cn":"走吧，维伦。去你想去的地方吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC47225208EC0289","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1720849023:1":{"text":"I'm serious. That isn't a blessing, it's advice.","source_cn":"另外……这不是一句祝福，而是一句劝告哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65E7CACF9C35A29B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1720849024:0":{"text":"You may wish to start running. Adrion looks like he's coming after you, with company.","source_cn":"赶紧跑吧，亚德里恩好像带着人追上来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC60DCA1EFD10FB7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1720849025:0":{"text":"Wait, what—","source_cn":"什么——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x925ECFC4FCF0E737","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1720850001:":{"text":"Stop!","source_cn":"站住！<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE33D19A325A9265A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1720850002:":{"text":"Move, move, move!","source_cn":"快快快，快跑！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x761737912DC0A5CC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Move, move, move!","female":"Move, move, move!","variant_male_record_index":"230817","variant_female_record_index":"230818","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1720850003:":{"text":"Why am I running too?!","source_cn":"为什么我也要跑啊！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8A95C9525B0398B9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Why am I running too?!","female":"Why am I running too?!","variant_male_record_index":"230819","variant_female_record_index":"230820","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1720850004:":{"text":"Ahaha!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x774FC699302BB026","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:35:17020845:0":{"text":"Charlotte's fiancé rushes over with his men. Valen grabs you and runs, while Charlotte bursts out laughing.","source_cn":"夏洛蒂的未婚夫带着人冲了上来，维伦拉上你就跑，夏洛蒂则...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE1A556167D342E14","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Charlotte's fiancé rushes over with his men. Valen grabs you and runs, while Charlotte bursts out laughing.","female":"Charlotte's fiancé rushes over with his men. Valen grabs you and runs, while Charlotte bursts out laughing.","variant_male_record_index":"236455","variant_female_record_index":"236456","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:36:17020844:0":{"text":"With the bouquet and the box in hand, you and Valen arrive at Charlotte's engagement banquet. Valen steps forward and asks Charlotte to dance, and she happily accepts.","source_cn":"你们带着花和宝盒来到了夏洛蒂的订婚宴，维伦上前邀请夏洛...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x87767AE66565A511","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"With the bouquet and the box in han